## HomePay by Care.com:

Families who hire a nanny or in-home caregiver directly usually become
household employers, which brings payroll and tax obligations most
people don't expect. HomePay by Care.com handles that side of it - payroll, tax
withholding, and the federal and state filings that come with employing
someone at home - so families can pay a caregiver correctly without
learning tax law. It is a separate paid service from the Care.com
marketplace, and we publish free guidance on nanny tax rules whether or
not a family uses HomePay.

[HomePay by Care.com](https://www.care.com/homepay)
